950" y="1500" width="240" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v75" value="External Sources&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&#x27;font-size:10px&#x27; color=&#x27;#6b7280&#x27;&gt;MoneySense · ABS&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;fillStyle=solid;strokeColor=#2b2f38;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#2b2f38;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1250" y="1500" width="160" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v76" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:12px&#x27;&gt;Agent interactions&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&#x27;#6b7280&#x27;&gt;(the graph decides; agents never call each other)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Conditional&lt;/b&gt; — runs only if an upstream export is true; unknown means no&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Input&lt;/b&gt; — passes only the exports the receiver imports&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Fan-out&lt;/b&gt; — one task per list item, at most 5 (“first 5 of N”)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Handoff&lt;/b&gt; — out_of_scope → one allowed agent, once&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Confirmation chain&lt;/b&gt; — act runs offers in order; an earlier receipt fills a later offer" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f7f8fa;fillStyle=solid;strokeColor=#c3c8d0;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#2b2f38;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="1420" width="450" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v77" value="&lt;b style=&#x27;font-size:12px&#x27;&gt;Removed in v5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• LangGraph pause and /workflows resume&lt;br&gt;• card-block and dispute dialogs&lt;br&gt;• chat checkpoints (tables kept)&lt;br&gt;• 8-node graph, separate Document agent&lt;br&gt;• separate RM pipeline" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f7f8fa;fillStyle=solid;strokeColor=#c3c8d0;strokeWidth=1.2;fontColor=#2b2f38;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;sp